OL,3,GNEWSAMinister defends MSP colleague
OL,4,Aafter transport committee blunder
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking on BBC Radio Scotland
OL,7,FBreakfast, Gethins stood up for
OL,8,FStevenson's character, describing her
OL,9,Fas "a really good colleague and
OL,10,Ffantastic local advocate" but said it
OL,11,Fwould be unfair for him to comment on
OL,12,Fher committee question as he was not at
OL,13,Fthe meeting.
